{"ref":"passive:mini-guardian","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Impostor_Rina.gif","w":40,"h":53}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Emergency Meeting)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Mini Guardian is a passive item from the Emergency Meeting DLC of Vampire Survivors."]},{"k":"p","c":["Mini Guardian is added to the level up item pool after ",{"t":"Clear Debris","r":"weapon:clear-debris"}," reaches level 2. It is consumed upon Clear Debris evolving into ",{"t":"Clear Asteroids","r":"weapon:clear-asteroids"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Mini Guardian can be found as a stage item on ",{"t":"Polus Replica","r":"stage:polus-replica"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Passive item","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["18 December 2023 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["C1_SHRINK_GUARDI"]]},{"label":"Player stat","cells":[[{"t":"? (edit)","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Mini_Guardian?action=edit"}]]},{"label":"Rarity","cells":[["200"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["3"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[[{"t":"? (edit)","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Mini_Guardian?action=edit"}]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[[{"t":"? (edit)","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Mini_Guardian?action=edit"}]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[[{"t":"? (edit)","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Mini_Guardian?action=edit"}]]},{"label":"Stage item","cells":[["Polus Replica"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"effects","title":"Effects","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Mini Guardian mirrors the effects of ",{"t":"Laurel","r":"weapon:laurel"},", acting as a lesser version of the weapon. It also spawns a miniature, non-functional ",{"t":"Guardian Pina","r":"character:guardian-pina"}," that flies around the player's character. Each Mini Guardian level corresponds to the same level for Laurel."]},{"k":"p","c":["Once it is consumed after evolving Clear Debris, the Laurel effect disappears,